;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "SE\砂利を歩く.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\城崎家.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "200" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Hm?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Good evening, Shirozaki-san."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh, it's <STYLE ID="2">Kotaro-kun</STYLE>. What's up? Need something?"<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Ghost.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"What do you make of the witch business? Is </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi Kogori</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> a witch after all, do you think?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Who knows. I couldn't say. 
{PAUSE ""}
But <STYLE ID="3">she</STYLE> only came for the thirteenth-year memorial service. When you really think about it, the idea that she's mixed up in all the curse-killings so far is ridiculous." [TN: Buddhist memorials count the year of death as the first year.]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You're right. I think so too."</STYLE><PG>
"So, what do you want? You didn't come here at this hour just to ask that, did you?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Shirozaki-san, who do you think the culprit is?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"There is no culprit. Everyone's scared, so they're just killing anyone who looks suspicious, like a witch trial. 
{PAUSE ""}
It's horribly selfish, just what you'd expect of a settlement deep in the mountains."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see... You sound like you want to say you yourself have nothing to do with it."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, what are you getting at?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"If you seriously think there's no particular culprit, you're playing right into the real culprit's hands. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">As long as you think that way, you'll never be able to stop the curse-killings."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, I suppose so."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"And you're fine with that?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm not fine with it. But I'll make sure the girls who came from Motoki-cho get home safe. That's all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Shirozaki-san, don't you want to know the secret of the witch's power?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"You mean the danger sense?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes. </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi Kogori</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> has a witch's power. That's the secret I'm talking about."</STYLE><PG>
"You sound as if you know everything there is to know about the danger sense."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, naturally. </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">My wife</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had precognition, after all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, it's getting late. Make sure you're on time for the memorial service tomorrow. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Well, good night."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"W-wait a second! Don't you want to know the secret!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"This is my hunch, not precognition, but the curse-killings will probably all be over tomorrow."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Based on what..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Like I said, a hunch. There's no need to go poking into secrets without good reason."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Shirozaki-san, you've got that wrong. There's bound to be a curse-killing tomorrow."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'll tell you the secret of precognition. Then you'll be saved, Shirozaki-san."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Say, before that, there's one thing I want to ask."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What is it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Who are you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, good night."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸古い.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
"A curse-killing tomorrow, huh..."
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------